          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 230.425pt" rowspan="7">
                        <p class="CellBodyC"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-50.120.070a1.86120.jpg" width="301" height="199"  alt="" title="" /></p>

                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="italic">A lightwell in a commercial setting.</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 229.77430000000004pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">A frontage where the facade is set back from the frontage line by an elevated terrace or a sunken lightwell. This type buffers residential or commercial uses from urban sidewalks and removes the private yard from public encroachment. Terraces are suitable for conversion to outdoor cafes.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color: #B2B2B2;border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 229.77430000000004pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBodyBold"><span class="bold">B. Size</span></p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">Depth, Clear</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">5&#39; min.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-40_A.86120.png" width="16" height="14"  alt="" title="" /></p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">Height, Landing</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyP2">Terrace (above Sidewalk)</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">6&#39; max.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-40_B.86120.png" width="16" height="14"  alt="" title="" /></p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyP2">Lightwell (below Sidewalk)</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">6&#39; max.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-40_C.86120.png" width="16" height="14"  alt="" title="" /></p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color: #B2B2B2;border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 229.77430000000004pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBodyBold"><span class="bold">C. Miscellaneous</span></p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 230.425pt" rowspan="8">
                        <p class="CellBodyC"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-50.120.070a2.86120.jpg" width="302" height="200"  alt="" title="" /></p>

                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="italic">A lightwell frontage for a townhouse building.</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 229.77430000000004pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">A short wall, hedge, or fence shall be placed along the BTL where it is not defined by a building.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 17.889pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 135.0672pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 76.8181pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
